  * Top Media Services now reads the DPI 7-day CUMULATIVE store instead of the
    live 60s exfil window, so the table persists between streams (was blinking
    empty whenever nothing was streaming that instant). Cards + Active Streams
    stay live (active-now). Falls back to live exfil if cumulative is absent. (#728)

